#.  POSIX.1-2001 documents errors
#.  EAGAIN, EBADF, ECONNABORTED, EINTR, EINVAL, EMFILE,
#.  ENFILE, ENOBUFS, ENOMEM, ENOTSOCK, EOPNOTSUPP, EPROTO, EWOULDBLOCK.
#.  In addition, SUSv2 documents EFAULT and ENOSR.
